P actions make_etude
P memjob 1048576
P memory_limit 1000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterStaticBuckling
P version stable
A memjeveux 128.0
A args -max_base 300000
A tpmax 9000.0
F comm AsterStaticBucklingparam.in D 1
F comm AsterStaticBuckling.comm D  1
F mess AsterStaticBuckling.log R  6
F mmed AsterStaticBucklinginput.med D  20
F rmed AsterStaticBucklingoutput.rmed R  80
F libr AsterStaticBuckling_objective.csv R  27
